== the_palette_of_categories_for_a_number
note: 27 rows with NA in educ or wage dropped (line 2)
note: 35 rows with NA in educ, wage or hours dropped (line 3)
error[Z0401]: `okabe_ito` is the palette of categories, but `color` shows `hours` on a continuous scale
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:16
  |
4 | h.scale(color: okabe_ito)
  |                ^^^^^^^^^ a palette of categories
  |
  = help: a continuous scale takes `viridis`, or the colours to pass through from its lowest value to its highest, as in `scale(color: ["white", "steelblue"])`

